{
    "title": "Crystalyze: Crystal Guide",
    "description": "Whether you're a crystal collector, a baby witch, or a seasoned Reiki Lightworker, Crystalyze's crystal guide will enhance your knowledge of crystals, elevate your practice, and support your spiritual healing journey. \r\n\r\nIt's important to note that Crystalyze is not a crystal identifier or stone identifier. Accurate identification of crystals and stones cannot be done through a photo alone.\r\n\r\nPerhaps you need a stone for protection, spiritual healing, or to open the Third Eye Chakra? Discover how different crystals and stones harness the power of the moon, enhance psychic abilities, channel astrological energies, and attract more love and abundance into your life.\r\n\r\nDiscover the Power of Crystals:\r\n    - Explore intuitive descriptions and high-quality images of 155 crystals and stones. Learn about their metaphysical properties, physical characteristics, and geographic locations.\r\n    - Connect with the crystal or stone that resonates with your Zodiac Signs, Planets, or Elements, and understand their relevance to different Chakras.\r\n    - Align your spiritual healing practice with lunar rhythms and astrology using the comprehensive Moon Calendar and Daily Journal.\r\n    - Chronicle your journey by adding private notes for each stone or crystal, creating a personalized catalog.\r\n\r\nExperience Crystalyze Premium:\r\n    - Elevate your practice by adding photos of your own crystals and stones and categorizing them into list of Own, Favorite, and Wishlist.\r\n    - Learn about the spiritual healing properties through Crystal Care, Cleansing & Charging,  Numerology, and Affirmations, equipping yourself with the knowledge to nurture your connection with your crystals and stones.\r\n\r\nMore than a crystal identifier, this app is for those deeply interested in the holistic and spiritual aspects of crystals. With Crystalyze, dive deeper into the universe of crystals and stones, learn about their ties with astrology and align your practice with the moon phases for an enriching and healing experience. This is your all in one crystal guide without the need of a crystal identifier.\r\n\r\nAbout the Creators & Solo Developer:\r\nCrystalyze is the brainchild of a dedicated husband-and-wife team on a mission to spread love and light among all crystal and stone enthusiasts. We do not aim to be a crystal identifier or stone identifier app, but as the most trusted crystal guide for all enthusiasts!\r\n\r\nWe are so grateful for your support!\r\n\r\nHaley & Ken\r\n\r\nYou can also access our crystal guide at:\r\nhttps://www.crystalyzeguide.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Whether you&#39;re a crystal collector, a baby witch, or a seasoned Reiki Lightworker, Crystalyze&#39;s crystal guide will enhance your knowledge of crystals, elevate your practice, and support your spiritual healing journey. <br><br>It&#39;s important to note that Crystalyze is not a crystal identifier or stone identifier. Accurate identification of crystals and stones cannot be done through a photo alone.<br><br>Perhaps you need a stone for protection, spiritual healing, or to open the Third Eye Chakra? Discover how different crystals and stones harness the power of the moon, enhance psychic abilities, channel astrological energies, and attract more love and abundance into your life.<br><br>Discover the Power of Crystals:<br>    - Explore intuitive descriptions and high-quality images of 155 crystals and stones. Learn about their metaphysical properties, physical characteristics, and geographic locations.<br>    - Connect with the crystal or stone that resonates with your Zodiac Signs, Planets, or Elements, and understand their relevance to different Chakras.<br>    - Align your spiritual healing practice with lunar rhythms and astrology using the comprehensive Moon Calendar and Daily Journal.<br>    - Chronicle your journey by adding private notes for each stone or crystal, creating a personalized catalog.<br><br>Experience Crystalyze Premium:<br>    - Elevate your practice by adding photos of your own crystals and stones and categorizing them into list of Own, Favorite, and Wishlist.<br>    - Learn about the spiritual healing properties through Crystal Care, Cleansing &amp; Charging,  Numerology, and Affirmations, equipping yourself with the knowledge to nurture your connection with your crystals and stones.<br><br>More than a crystal identifier, this app is for those deeply interested in the holistic and spiritual aspects of crystals. With Crystalyze, dive deeper into the universe of crystals and stones, learn about their ties with astrology and align your practice with the moon phases for an enriching and healing experience. This is your all in one crystal guide without the need of a crystal identifier.<br><br>About the Creators &amp; Solo Developer:<br>Crystalyze is the brainchild of a dedicated husband-and-wife team on a mission to spread love and light among all crystal and stone enthusiasts. We do not aim to be a crystal identifier or stone identifier app, but as the most trusted crystal guide for all enthusiasts!<br><br>We are so grateful for your support!<br><br>Haley &amp; Ken<br><br>You can also access our crystal guide at:<br>https://www.crystalyzeguide.com",
